<title>UK: New hires at F&amp;C, Lehman Brothers in London.</title>
<headline>New hires at F&amp;C, Lehman Brothers in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONODN 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers has hired a new private client services director, while fund management group Foreign &amp; Colonial Emerging Markets (FCEM) has taken on a new Russian analyst.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Maher Adnan Al-Ariss would be a director for Middle East private clients accounts. He has joined from Saudi American Bank in Riyadh.</p>
<p>FCEM said Douglas Helfer has joined as a senior analyst specialising in Russia. He was previously at Brunswick Capital Management.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
</text>
